        "original_id": "f95af6ce-01eb-557c-b7e2-95aea4661974",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: The Venetian Macao, The Venetian Las Vegas, Macau\n- Organizations: KlingStubbins\n- Events: 10th IIFA Awards\n- Topics: building size, architectural design\n\nFacts:\n- The Venetian Macao has 10,500,000 square feet of floor area and is the seventh-largest building in the world by floor area.\n- The Venetian Macao is modeled on its sister casino resort, The Venetian Las Vegas.\n- The 10th IIFA Awards ceremony was held at The Venetian Macao in Macau from June 11 to June 13, 2009.\n- KlingStubbins designed the hotel tower at The Venetian Las Vegas.\n- The hotel tower at The Venetian Las Vegas has 36 stories and rises 475 feet.",
